<span id="A1.T5.2.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T5.2.8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Solve this math problem. Give the reasoning steps before giving the final answer on the last line by itself in the format of "[The answer is ]". Do not add anything other than the integer answer after "The answer is".\n\n{question}</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
